{"c":[{"name":"20261016T090048Z-3285f03cb5048d8e","text":"#47: an ended goal that observed drops its replay state and observed-window plan text (GoalRuns.releaseObserved); an open one stops when a window it read expires (onExpiry.goalReplays). The front window never expires while a reader is connected: expiry tests focus another app.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T093957Z-e60e9c18f259dd0d","text":"Heads-maker whole-form Asks reach the page planner as kind 'list' with page.scope.wholeForm true (intent-heads.ts), not kind 'all'; any page-goal rule gated on kind === 'list' (reveal follow-up, carry) must check wholeForm or it skips the journey's Ask.","type":"note"}]}
